# Environment Variables

# GitHub Personal Access Token (optional)
# Used for live GitHub API verification if needed in the future.
# The current implementation uses pre-verified CSV data.
# WARNING: Never commit a real token to source control.
# VITE_GITHUB_TOKEN=your_github_personal_access_token_here

# Base URL for the application (optional, used for production deployment)
# VITE_BASE_URL=https://your-domain.example.com
